  "body": "### Added\r\n\r\n* `HAVING` support\r\n\r\n### Changed\r\n\r\n* queries with conflicting `AND` branches are now considered invalid (only `is_file`, `is_dir`, `is_pipe`, etc. are supported by now)\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n* fixed unary minus handling\r\n* non-tty output now doesn't use ANSI colors #186 \r\n* other bugs fixed",
